left unsaid?

1641
01:32:33,682 --> 01:32:35,517
Have you lost
your mind?!

1642
01:32:35,618 --> 01:32:37,519
After living
20 years of a lie

1643
01:32:37,620 --> 01:32:39,622
when the truth would
have served us better?

1644
01:32:39,655 --> 01:32:42,024
Knowing what I know,
at least I could have had

1645
01:32:42,124 --> 01:32:45,093
