Tender is the Night.

1673
01:33:41,684 --> 01:33:42,951
Did you ever read it?

1674
01:33:44,687 --> 01:33:47,022
I read it out loud
to you. You had pneumonia.

1675
01:33:48,957 --> 01:33:50,893
