No, you didn't.
You said something sad.

1685
01:34:23,391 --> 01:34:26,561
Well, I think
we've done very well here.

1686
01:34:26,762 --> 01:34:28,063
Don't you, Eleanor?

1687
01:34:28,163 --> 01:34:29,732
Yeah.

1688
01:34:29,798 --> 01:34:31,967
Porter?

1689
01:34:32,067 --> 01:34:33,769
Porter?

1690
01:34:33,869 --> 01:34:36,304
Yes.
Very, very well.

1691
