I fell in love with you.

1727
01:36:05,327 --> 01:36:09,097
And I am a fool.

1728
01:36:09,197 --> 01:36:11,133
And I know that.

1729
01:36:16,438 --> 01:36:18,373
So, is there
anything left?

1730
01:36:29,852 --> 01:36:31,519
There's a whole lot left.

1731
01:36:40,262 --> 01:36:41,563
Porter.

1732
