I've never
loved anyone else.

1742
01:37:04,552 --> 01:37:06,922
Who knows? Maybe someday
she'll, uh...

1743
01:37:07,022 --> 01:37:09,291
let me back in the door.

1744
01:37:09,391 --> 01:37:11,293
Or, uh...

1745
01:37:11,393 --> 01:37:15,898
